# reel's diff demo: a pull request's change, walked through hunk by hunk. demos/code has both versions, so the diff
# stays the same as the repository moves on; `Diff <file> since <revision>` reads the older one from git instead.
# `mise run demos diff` records it.
Import //demos/reel.reelpreset
Screen code

Output //docs/media/diff.mp4
Output //docs/media/diff.gif
Set Viewport 1100x620
Set FontSize 18
# The whole diff fills the screen, and the last hunk sits where subtitles go: they are for the muted feeds only.
Set Subtitles social|feed|square ? on : off
Intro@crossfade,ease-out,600ms square ? "reel" "What changed" : 2s
Outro@fade,800ms square ? "Recorded with reel" "brew install --cask mpdreamz/tap/reel" : 2s

Code code/SpeechClock-before.swift
Say "Here's the clock before this change."
Diff@crossfade,700ms code/SpeechClock-before.swift code/SpeechClock.swift
Say "And here's what the change did, line by line."
Go hunk 1
Mark "markers" 1
Say "It keeps the markers each line reaches,"
Mark off
Go hunk 3
Focus lines 16-18
Say "fills them in as a line starts,"
Focus off
Go hunk 4
Callout "func time(of marker: String)" "new: when a marker comes"
Say "and answers when one comes. Even a renamed argument shows, word by word."
Callout off
Sleep 1s
